{{Term/Store|Heat Resistance||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
Heat Resistance is an [[Added Effect]] that prevents [[Link]] from taking damage due to [[Extremely Hot Zone]]s. Some environments require a higher Effect level. This Effect does not affect damage taken from [[Scorching Climate]]s, [[Fire]], Fire-based attacks, or [[Lava]], and it has a maximum potency of level two.

In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, the following [[Material]]s and [[Armor]] pieces grant Heat Resistance:

